  "对数均值 meanlog" = "Log mean", "对数标准差 sdlog" = "Log standard deviation", "尺度参数 scale" = "Scale",
  "位置参数 location" = "Location", "成功概率 p" = "Success probability p", "试验次数 n" = "Number of trials n",
  "均值参数 λ" = "Mean parameter λ", "目标成功次数 size" = "Target successes", "总体成功元素数 m" = "Population successes m",
  "总体失败元素数 n" = "Population failures n", "抽取数量 k" = "Draw size k",
  "样本量 × 重复次数最多为 5,000,000。改变参数与随机种子后重新生成，可以比较分布形状、抽样波动和收敛速度。" = "Sample size × repetitions may not exceed 5,000,000. Change parameters and the random seed to compare distribution shapes, sampling variation, and convergence speed.",
  "生成分布样本" = "Generate samples", "教学解读" = "Teaching Notes", "理论与样本统计" = "Theory vs Sample Statistics",
  "分布形状" = "Distribution Shape", "分布函数 CDF" = "CDF", "Q-Q 图" = "Q-Q Plot", "大数定律" = "Law of Large Numbers",
  "样本均值与中心极限定理" = "Sample Means & CLT", "模拟数据" = "Simulated Data",
  "下载教学报告 TXT" = "Download teaching report (TXT)", "下载随机样本 CSV" = "Download random sample (CSV)",
  "下载重复抽样均值 CSV" = "Download repeated sample means (CSV)",
  "面向零基础学习者：先建立直觉，再观察模拟，最后理解公式。每个实验都可以改变参数并重新运行。" = "For complete beginners: build intuition first, observe simulations, then understand the formulas. Every experiment can be rerun with different parameters.",
  "1 认识数据" = "1 Understand Data", "总体、样本与变量" = "Population, samples, and variables",
  "2 描述数据" = "2 Describe Data", "中心与离散程度" = "Center and spread",
  "3 理解概率" = "3 Understand Probability", "重复实验与长期频率" = "Repeated experiments and long-run frequency",
  "4 排列组合" = "4 Permutations & Combinations", "顺序、放回与计数" = "Order, replacement, and counting",
  "5 概率规则" = "5 Probability Rules", "补集、交集、并集与独立" = "Complements, intersections, unions, and independence",
  "6 条件概率" = "6 Conditional Probability", "已知信息与贝叶斯更新" = "Known information and Bayesian updating",
  "7 认识分布" = "7 Understand Distributions", "随机变量与常见分布" = "Random variables and common distributions",
  "8 学习推断" = "8 Learn Inference", "抽样、标准误与区间" = "Sampling, standard error, and intervals",
  "9 假设检验" = "9 Hypothesis Testing", "P 值、错误率与功效" = "P-values, error rates, and power",
  "学习路线" = "Learning Path", "怎样使用教学模式" = "How to Use Learning Mode",
  "建议从左到右学习。每一部分都遵循“生活例子 → 动手实验 → 图形观察 → 数学公式 → 常见误区”的顺序。学习不会修改已导入的数据或模型结果。" = "Study from left to right. Each section follows real-life example, hands-on experiment, visual observation, mathematical formula, and common misconception. Learning activities do not modify imported data or model results.",
  "第一阶段：描述" = "Stage 1: Description", "第二阶段：随机性" = "Stage 2: Randomness", "第三阶段：分布" = "Stage 3: Distributions", "第四阶段：推断" = "Stage 4: Inference",
  "先学会区分变量，并用均值、中位数、方差和图形概括数据。" = "Learn to distinguish variables and summarize data with means, medians, variances, and charts.",
  "通过硬币和骰子认识事件、概率以及短期波动。" = "Use coins and dice to understand events, probability, and short-run variation.",
  "理解随机变量的可能取值以及概率如何分配。" = "Understand possible values of random variables and how probability is distributed.",
  "理解为什么样本会变化，以及如何用样本估计总体。" = "Understand why samples vary and how samples estimate populations.",
  "认识数据" = "Understand Data", "总体、样本和变量" = "Population, Samples, and Variables",
  "总体是想研究的全部对象，样本是实际收集到的一部分对象。参数描述总体，统计量由样本计算得到。" = "A population is the complete group of interest; a sample is the part actually observed. Parameters describe populations, while statistics are computed from samples.",
  "数值变量" = "Numeric Variable", "数值具有可解释的距离，可以计算加减、均值和方差。" = "Numeric values have meaningful distances and support arithmetic, means, and variances.",
  "类别变量" = "Categorical Variable", "类别用于分组；类别编码成数字后，数字大小通常没有计算意义。" = "Categories define groups. Numeric category codes usually have no arithmetic meaning.",
  "选择一个例子" = "Choose an example", "它属于哪种变量？" = "What type of variable is it?", "检查答案" = "Check Answer",
  "概率实验" = "Probability Experiment", "概率从重复实验开始" = "Probability Begins with Repeated Experiments",
  "一次结果无法预测，但大量重复后，事件发生的相对频率通常会在理论概率附近波动。改变实验次数，观察蓝线是否逐渐稳定。" = "One outcome is unpredictable, but over many repetitions the relative frequency usually fluctuates near the theoretical probability. Change the number of trials and observe whether the blue line stabilizes.",
  "随机实验" = "Random Experiment", "抛硬币" = "Flip a Coin", "掷骰子" = "Roll a Die", "实验次数" = "Number of Trials", "正面概率" = "Probability of Heads", "骰子面数" = "Number of Die Faces", "关注的点数" = "Target Roll", "运行概率实验" = "Run Probability Experiment",
  "常见误区" = "Common Misconception", "理论概率为 0.5，并不表示每 10 次一定恰好出现 5 次；它描述的是长期比例，而不是短期保证。" = "A theoretical probability of 0.5 does not guarantee exactly 5 successes in every 10 trials. It describes a long-run proportion, not a short-run guarantee.",
  "排列组合" = "Permutations & Combinations", "排列与组合：先问两个问题" = "Permutations and Combinations: Ask Two Questions First",
  "从 n 个不同对象中选 r 个时，先判断顺序是否重要，再判断选过的对象能否放回。这两个判断决定使用哪一个公式。" = "When choosing r items from n distinct items, first decide whether order matters, then whether selected items can be replaced. These two decisions determine the formula.",
  "不放回，顺序重要：排列" = "Without Replacement, Order Matters: Permutation",
  "例如从 10 人中选出冠军、亚军和季军。" = "For example, choosing first, second, and third place from 10 people.",
  "不放回，顺序不重要：组合" = "Without Replacement, Order Does Not Matter: Combination",
  "例如从 10 人中选 3 人组成小组。" = "For example, choosing a team of 3 from 10 people.",
  "放回，顺序重要" = "With Replacement, Order Matters", "例如使用 n 个字符组成长度为 r 的密码。" = "For example, forming a password of length r from n characters.",
  "放回，顺序不重要" = "With Replacement, Order Does Not Matter",
  "例如从 n 种口味中选择 r 个冰淇淋球，可重复选择。" = "For example, choosing r scoops from n flavors with repeated flavors allowed.",
  "对象总数 n" = "Total Number of Items n", "选取数量 r" = "Number Selected r",
  "比较四种计数方法" = "Compare Four Counting Methods", "最常见的失分点" = "Most Common Exam Mistake",
  "组合不考虑先后顺序。同一组对象如果只是选择成员，交换排列顺序不会产生新的组合；如果是名次、座位或密码，顺序通常重要。" = "Combinations ignore order. If the task only selects members, rearranging the same members does not create a new combination. Rankings, seats, and passwords usually depend on order.",
  "概率规则" = "Probability Rules", "概率的四条基本规则" = "Four Basic Probability Rules",
  "先把两个事件拆成四种不会重叠的情形，再计算补集、交集和并集。拖动条件概率，还可以观察两个事件何时独立。" = "Split two events into four non-overlapping cases, then calculate complements, intersections, and unions. Adjust the conditional probabilities to see when the events are independent.",
  "补集与加法公式" = "Complement and Addition Rules", "乘法与全概率公式" = "Multiplication and Total Probability Rules",
  "P(A)：事件 A 的概率" = "P(A): Probability of Event A", "P(B|A)：A 发生时 B 的概率" = "P(B|A): Probability of B Given A",
  "P(B|Aᶜ)：A 不发生时 B 的概率" = "P(B|Aᶜ): Probability of B Given Not A", "计算概率规则" = "Calculate Probability Rules",
  "怎样判断独立" = "How to Identify Independence",
  "如果知道 A 是否发生不会改变 B 的概率，即 P(B|A)=P(B)，那么 A 与 B 独立。互斥通常不等于独立。" = "If knowing whether A occurred does not change the probability of B, so P(B|A)=P(B), then A and B are independent. Mutually exclusive events are generally not independent.",
  "条件概率" = "Conditional Probability", "条件概率与贝叶斯公式" = "Conditional Probability and Bayes' Formula",
  "条件概率与贝叶斯：先数人数" = "Conditional Probability and Bayes: Count People First",
  "条件概率就是把范围缩小：已经知道检测为阳性，只在所有阳性者中计算真正患病者所占的比例。下面的两个式子表达的是同一件事。" = "Conditional probability narrows the group. Once a positive test is known, calculate the proportion truly affected among everyone who tested positive. The two formulas below express the same idea.",
  "人数版（建议先记这个）" = "Count Version (learn this first)", "概率版" = "Probability Version",
  "条件概率回答“已知 B 已经发生时，A 的概率是多少”。下面用检测案例说明：即使检测很准确，阳性者真正患病的比例仍会受到患病率影响。" = "Conditional probability asks how likely A is once B is known. This screening example shows that even an accurate test depends on the underlying prevalence when interpreting a positive result.",
  "模拟人数" = "Simulated Population", "患病率" = "Prevalence", "灵敏度" = "Sensitivity", "特异度" = "Specificity",
  "计算贝叶斯结果" = "Calculate Bayesian Result", "基准率误区" = "Base-rate Fallacy",
  "只看检测准确率会高估阳性结果的可信度。当目标事件本来很少见时，数量庞大的未患病人群也可能产生不少假阳性。" = "Looking only at test accuracy can overstate the credibility of a positive result. When the condition is rare, the much larger healthy population can still produce many false positives.",
  "当前分布的考试公式" = "Exam Formulas for This Distribution",
  "先认清取值范围与参数定义，再记概率函数、期望和方差。不同教材的参数化可能不同，请以这里标出的定义为准。" = "First identify the support and parameter definitions, then learn the probability function, expectation, and variance. Textbooks may use different parameterizations, so follow the definitions shown here.",
  "概率质量函数（PMF）" = "Probability Mass Function (PMF)", "概率密度函数（PDF）" = "Probability Density Function (PDF)",
  "期望" = "Expectation", "考试常用关系" = "Common Exam Relationship",
  "描述统计与分布" = "Descriptive Statistics & Distributions", "抽样与推断" = "Sampling & Inference", "从样本走向总体" = "From Samples to Populations",
  "不同样本会产生不同的样本均值。标准误描述样本均值的波动，置信区间则给出与数据相容的总体均值范围。" = "Different samples produce different sample means. Standard error describes their variation, while a confidence interval gives a range of population means compatible with the data.",
  "总体均值" = "Population Mean", "总体标准差" = "Population Standard Deviation", "置信水平" = "Confidence Level", "重复抽样并生成区间" = "Resample and Create Intervals",
